{
  "name": "dsh-whale-greeting",
  "version": "0.6.1",
  "description": "DSH 对话区问候插件：大幅问候卡、24 张表情包头像每次随机、8 时段 × 6 说法 + 120 句轮换不重复；语音问候（肥鱼声库 FeiyuVoice-CosyVoice3 音色，卡角一键开关）；一轮任务跑完交付完成报告（含用时、第几件，出错换警告形态）；长跑时每 4~8 分钟随机说一句陪伴；需要授权时由小鲸接管输入框向主人请示（允许一次 / 拒绝，保留工具详情）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "src",
    "assets",
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "greeting",
    "whale",
    "maid",
    "companion",
    "voice"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.13.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Mr-Luo0036/dsh-whale-greeting.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Mr-Luo0036/dsh-whale-greeting#readme",
  "author": "Mr-Luo0036",
  "license": "MIT",
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/"
  }
}
